Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.82,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3450,4800)\pos(640,358)}Episode 20
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.82,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3450,4800)\pos(640,532)}Death of Sun Ce
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.61,0:00:16.46,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Sun Ce dominated the Jiangdong area and took Lujiang,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.46,0:00:18.54,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,his momentum overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.14,0:00:23.49,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He sent Zhang Hong to Xuchang to report his victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.40,0:00:26.78,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,But his request to become Grand Marshal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.78,0:00:28.72,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,was refused by Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:31.14,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Thus, Sun Ce harbored deep resentment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.14,0:00:33.70,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He planned on assaulting Xuchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.75,0:00:38.66,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Ergo, the Administrator of Wu Commandery, Xu Gong,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.66,0:00:42.42,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,clandestinely sent a messenger to Xuchang
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.12,0:00:44.32,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(278.4,449.6)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1620,2220)}Xǔ Gòng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.42,0:00:45.00,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,to warn Cao Cao of these developments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.89,0:00:59.40,Default,Xu Gong,0,0,0,,Tonight, cross the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.40,0:01:03.56,Default,Xu Gong,0,0,0,,Sneak this letter to Chancellor Cao in Xuchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.56,0:01:04.40,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.40,0:01:05.04,Default,Xu Gong,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.73,0:01:08.50,Default,Xu Gong,0,0,0,,This is extremely classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.50,0:01:10.40,Default,Xu Gong,0,0,0,,You ought to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:11.20,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.84,0:01:13.02,Default,Patrols,0,0,0,,Who is crossing the river?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.02,0:01:14.20,Default,Patrols,0,0,0,,Stop now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.53,0:01:16.45,Default,Retainer,0,0,0,,The Administrator of Wu, Xu Gong!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.45,0:01:19.18,Default,Retainer,0,0,0,,During the day, we saw General Sun Ce drill his army!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.18,0:01:21.23,Default,Retainer,0,0,0,,Now we are crossing back to our office!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.16,0:01:41.39,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,We have a strong army and ample food.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.39,0:01:44.30,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,If you can wipe out Huang Zu and cut down Liu Biao,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.30,0:01:47.40,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,you can secure Jiangdong with only the Yangzi River!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.40,0:01:51.12,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Afterwards, nothing in the world will trouble us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.03,0:01:56.77,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Zibu, your views of the world differ from mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.71,0:02:03.50,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Right now, Cao Cao controls \Nmany lords through the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.50,0:02:06.60,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Yuan Shao has Hebei and is like a greedy tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:09.25,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,How could I limit my world to Jiangdong
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.25,0:02:11.18,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,and take no actions whatsoever?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.74,0:02:15.90,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Sire has overseen vigorous\N training for our men yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.90,0:02:19.34,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Today, we are here to monitor the building of ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.34,0:02:22.58,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Will you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.70,0:02:26.43,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.11,0:02:35.72,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Report! An envoy of Xǔ Gòng was crossing the river with this letter, and was detained by our patrols!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.15,0:02:46.86,Default,Xu Gong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"Sun Ce is brave and valiant, akin to Xiang Ji."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.15,0:02:46.86,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Xiang Ji, AKA. Xiang Yu, was the hegemon of Chu, who led the defeat of the Qin dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.86,0:02:50.68,Default,Xu Gong,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}The court ought to reward him, \Nthen summon him back to the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.68,0:02:52.68,Default,Xu Gong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"Do not let him dominate Jiangdong,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.68,0:02:54.30,Default,Xu Gong,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}or he will become a menace!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.78,0:03:18.23,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,As of now, The realm is in chaos, the lords scramble for power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.80,0:03:22.00,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Those without ambitions will be subject to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:28.95,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Zibu, now you understand the world that I dream of...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.44,0:03:31.54,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.28,0:03:33.36,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(291.2,457.6)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1700,2080)}Sūn Cè\NStyled: Bófú
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.64,0:03:45.42,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,General Sun Ce has sent an envoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.37,0:04:09.84,Default,Sun Ce Envoy,0,0,0,,General Sun is hosting a banquet in Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.84,0:04:13.52,Default,Sun Ce Envoy,0,0,0,,He invites you, Mister Xu, to join him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.15,0:04:26.12,Default,Xu Gong,0,0,0,,Let me prepare my chariot and horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.12,0:04:27.96,Default,Xu Gong,0,0,0,,I will go when I am ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.98,0:04:29.46,Default,Sun Ce Envoy,0,0,0,,Mister Xu, there is no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.46,0:04:32.76,Default,Sun Ce Envoy,0,0,0,,General Sun has already prepared your vehicle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.38,0:04:49.68,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Sire, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:52.68,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,That?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.68,0:04:53.34,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.06,0:05:07.63,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,My lord, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.94,0:05:25.44,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.78,0:05:37.66,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Who is that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.18,0:05:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sire, that is...\N- Sir, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.83,0:05:42.06,Default,Believer,0,0,0,,That is an Immortal! Kneel down to him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.83,0:05:42.06,Note (Potential style?),Believer,0,0,0,,Note: Referring to the mythological Taoist Immortal, or shénxiān (神仙), godly figures who attained immortality through self-cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.06,0:05:42.89,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Scram!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.89,0:05:43.79,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,What "Immortal"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:45.96,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Go ask who he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:51.12,Default,Believer,0,0,0,,Sir, the exalted Immortal will punish us if we don't kneel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:54.46,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Sire, get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.46,0:05:55.66,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.66,0:05:58.48,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Zibu, don't tell me even you believe in witchcraft?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.90,0:05:57.73,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.39,0:06:02.00,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,If Sire won't get down, then please get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:03.38,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,You can't stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.38,0:06:04.65,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,You can't stay here, Sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.65,0:06:05.88,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,I am Sun Ce of Jiangdong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.15,0:06:07.74,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Why is no one kneeling to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.74,0:06:09.90,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,This is an insult!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.19,0:06:46.82,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Zhongmou, please task General Cheng Pu with investigating those three shady characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.82,0:06:47.56,Default,Sun Quan,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.56,0:06:48.10,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.51,0:06:51.97,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,I don't care who those three people are!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:54.72,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Tell General Cheng to capture that sorcerer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:55.51,Default,Sun Quan,0,0,0,,As you wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:06:57.02,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Sire,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:07:00.49,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,what just happened was mere peasants
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.49,0:07:02.42,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,seeking help from that Immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.42,0:07:03.72,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,That is a trifling matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:05.68,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(937.6,470.4)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1940,2240)}Zhāng Zhāo\NStyled: Zǐbù
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.72,0:07:06.40,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Sire, why be angry over them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.97,0:07:08.68,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,How can I not be angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.48,0:07:11.06,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,I am the lord of this region!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.06,0:07:14.02,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Why should I prostrate myself to some heretic magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.69,0:07:18.09,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,I will find out who that revolting sorcerer is,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.09,0:07:20.20,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,and his ways of bewitching my citizens!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.14,0:07:22.94,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Sire...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.64,0:07:26.48,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Madam Dowager!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.10,0:07:35.78,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Your son shows his respects to mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:39.61,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,Rise now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.96,0:07:47.04,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,My son, why do you look so unhappy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.54,0:07:51.03,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,May I ask why you are here, mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.63,0:07:55.64,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,I have been inside too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.64,0:07:59.48,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,Just now, I heard people saying \Nthat an Immortal entered the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:03.92,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,In curing patients, he is always effective,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.92,0:08:08.12,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,and when asked for predictions,\N his foresight is like that of a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.12,0:08:12.04,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,I have nothing else to do, \Nso I want to see him for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.04,0:08:15.48,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Mother, the markets are littered and crowded, why take a walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.82,0:08:18.32,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Moreover, how can an "Immortal" exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.77,0:08:23.90,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,I seldom go for a walk, \NI only wish to expel the boredom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.84,0:08:28.22,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,Folk sayings are not always false.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.82,0:08:34.80,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,The world can hold many surprises unimaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.76,0:08:53.09,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Come out! All of you, come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.39,0:09:10.46,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.60,0:09:15.16,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Who told my mother of \Nthat heretic street magician!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.76,0:09:23.62,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Sire, let us take care of this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.62,0:09:26.10,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,No need to be angry at your own family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.64,0:09:32.28,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,What are you still kneeling for? Help our lord to rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.95,0:09:35.24,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,My own home disturbed by that foul sorcerer!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.24,0:09:36.53,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,How can I rest?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.62,0:09:46.22,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,I am going hunting in Mount Dantu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.22,0:09:47.20,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,No more of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.65,0:10:19.56,Thinking,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Back then, on the Shenting Ridge, I ascended to the temple there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.56,0:10:24.07,Thinking,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Facing the idols of illustrious Guangwu, I swore an oath:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.56,0:10:24.16,Note (Potential style?),Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Note: Emperor Guāngwǔ, Liú Xiù, was an imperial scion who lived as a farmer, but would later restore the Han Dynasty in 25 CE
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.07,0:10:27.78,Thinking,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12}if I can revive my late father's \Nfoundations in Jiāngdōng,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.89,0:10:32.96,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: 9-11 AM based on {\i1}the Earthly Branches.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.78,0:10:31.88,Thinking,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I would rebuild that temple, \Nvenerate it at every snake's hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.14,0:10:37.40,Thinking,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Today, Jiāngdōng is at peace. \NIt is time to honor that oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.12,0:10:42.26,Thinking,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If at this mountain peak, I could build another temple,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:46.05,Thinking,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12}one which can let the people\N stand tall and see the distance,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.05,0:10:50.56,Thinking,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and revere our pioneers, wouldn't that be better?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.57,0:12:53.53,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:55.78,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.41,0:12:58.80,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.98,0:13:06.02,Default,All,0,0,0,,Sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.98,0:13:08.68,Default,All,0,0,0,,Sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.42,0:13:10.35,Default,All,0,0,0,,Sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.88,0:13:15.88,Default,All,0,0,0,,Sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.83,0:13:29.67,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Sire...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.62,0:13:33.15,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,I was too careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.95,0:13:36.25,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,I came one step too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.32,0:13:40.10,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Zibu...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.34,0:13:45.44,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,I want to build a temple for {\i1}Guāngwǔ,{\i0} so that the people can behold...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.45,0:13:49.34,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,... So that people never forget... \NThe greatness men can achieve...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.34,0:13:51.02,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.02,0:13:52.12,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:20.77,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,How severe is his condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.47,0:14:26.35,Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,The arrow was poisoned.\NI'm afraid it has already spread to his bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.35,0:14:28.80,Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,He must rest for a hundred days and do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:33.35,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,My son has suffered this disaster,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.35,0:14:36.40,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,all due to his volatility and arrogance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.48,0:14:51.24,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,Hang it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.00,0:14:54.22,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,To the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.99,0:15:35.78,Default,Servant,0,0,0,,Sire, you can get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.24,0:15:37.22,Default,Servants,0,0,0,,Sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.47,0:15:44.47,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,A blessing from the Heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.24,0:15:50.56,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.29,0:15:54.03,Default,Elder Qiao,0,0,0,,Husband!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.35,0:15:57.35,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,What blessings from the heavens?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.10,0:16:01.60,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,I am destined to be a hero, not to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.60,0:16:04.08,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,How could Xu Gong's servants be able to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.41,0:16:06.44,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,Please don't strain yourself, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.15,0:16:11.56,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,For two months, I've told you to be careful at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.56,0:16:14.75,Default,Elder Qiao,0,0,0,,You are still injured.\NYou must go back and rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.80,0:16:26.69,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,What are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.26,0:16:29.94,Default,Elder Qiao,0,0,0,,Because of your illness,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.94,0:16:33.00,Default,Elder Qiao,0,0,0,,your mother and I, along with the mansion servants,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.00,0:16:36.37,Default,Elder Qiao,0,0,0,,prayed on your behalf to the Immortal deities for a swift recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.46,0:16:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O spirits, please forgive him, \Nmy son is young and passionate.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.10,0:16:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let all disaster befall me in his stead.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.45,0:16:57.67,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,This whole mansion has fallen into devil worship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.95,0:17:04.00,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,How could I, Sun Ce, be aided by mystical deities?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.69,0:17:09.54,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,I detest witchcraft, and those swindling prophets who mislead men's hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.81,0:17:14.52,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Take them off! Do not let me see them again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.52,0:17:15.76,Default,Servants,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.76,0:17:16.58,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,Who dares!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.26,0:17:22.36,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,Without the help of Immortals, would we be here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.78,0:17:44.60,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Sun Ce recovered slightly from his wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:48.70,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,When Zhang Hong, sent to Xuchang to report of Sun Ce's victories,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.70,0:17:52.98,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,was returned with an envoy, \Nnow summoned in as a visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.67,0:18:01.52,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Sir, how many days have you been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.28,0:18:04.52,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(324.8,476.8)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1860,2260)}The Envoy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.07,0:18:05.00,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,It has been six days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.26,0:18:07.80,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,When do you return to Xuchang?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.58,0:18:10.78,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,I will go back to Xuchang tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.48,0:18:14.95,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,General, can you pass my words to Zhang Hong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.59,0:18:23.70,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,I would!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:26.10,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Only... Zibu here will not let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.99,0:18:31.62,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Sire, your wound has not healed yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.62,0:18:34.18,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,yet you have been playing Go for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.18,0:18:36.90,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,I believe that is enough for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.90,0:18:37.45,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.45,0:18:41.30,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Since the envoy will return to Xuchang tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.65,0:18:44.01,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,I only want to ask one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.01,0:18:46.61,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,I beseech you, Zibu, to permit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.01,0:18:58.01,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,I only want to ask this gentleman this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:19:00.96,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Does Cao Cao really fear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.94,0:19:06.72,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.11,0:19:08.44,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,He wouldn't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.92,0:19:11.51,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,It is most certainly not a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.51,0:19:13.83,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,Cao Cao really does fear you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.83,0:19:17.45,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,His advisors too all respect your Lordship. Only...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.45,0:19:18.40,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,Only...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.57,0:19:19.68,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Only what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.39,0:19:21.20,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Only what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:26.28,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,His Lordship said he would only ask one question.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.28,0:19:27.93,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.93,0:19:29.74,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,Yet I have spoken too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.74,0:19:31.12,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,so I must take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.79,0:19:39.44,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,Allow me one last sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.84,0:19:42.66,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,I hope that you, sir, maintain your iron strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.66,0:19:44.36,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,and get well soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.22,0:19:47.77,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,What iron strength is there to maintain?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.77,0:19:49.35,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,You intend to provoke me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.99,0:19:52.71,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.33,0:19:54.84,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.79,0:19:58.73,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Who would disregard me, Sun Ce?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.65,0:20:05.64,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,Only Guo Jia disregards.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.92,0:20:08.49,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Guo Jia?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.45,0:20:10.60,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.35,0:20:13.63,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,Sir, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.15,0:20:19.08,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,What Guo Jia said must be left unsaid!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.42,0:20:37.22,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,I take my leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.07,0:20:40.24,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Mister, halt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.34,0:20:44.18,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Sir, you have begun to speak,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.18,0:20:46.00,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,yet you are leaving too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.00,0:20:48.83,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Would this not make His Lordship angrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.83,0:20:50.54,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,No matter what words they are,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.54,0:20:52.24,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,please finish before leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.71,0:20:59.71,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,Guo Jia heard what Cao Cao said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.73,0:21:03.45,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,Sir, he was not afraid at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.36,0:21:07.08,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.90,0:21:15.26,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,He said that as you are an arrogant and witless cretin. A barbaric imbecile!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.43,0:21:18.24,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Is there more?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:19.42,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.42,0:21:20.08,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.08,0:21:20.88,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.26,0:21:32.04,Default,Envoy,0,0,0,,He said that one day, you will die in misery at the hands of lesser men.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.39,0:21:35.51,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,My liege...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.38,0:21:39.02,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Guō Jiā is but a base-born. He deserves death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.30,0:21:45.23,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Sire, please maintain calm!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.99,0:22:00.20,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,The nerve of that base-born!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.59,0:22:03.88,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,I vow to capture Xuchang!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.54,0:22:07.18,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Zibu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.75,0:22:08.28,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.44,0:22:13.40,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Chen Zhen came here as Yuan Shao's envoy. He's been here for days, why have I not been informed?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.26,0:22:15.16,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.14,0:22:20.69,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,You need to inform Sir Chen Zhen of my intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.50,0:22:23.96,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Tell him that I want to ally with Yuan Shao.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.54,0:22:28.56,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,We can attack Cao Cao in unison!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.58,0:22:29.82,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.50,0:22:34.18,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, I will summon the generals to the city top.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.18,0:22:36.74,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Tell Sir Chen Zhen to attend as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.38,0:22:39.76,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,We will discuss our strategy against Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.07,0:22:44.76,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,The doctor warned you to rest for one hundred days.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.38,0:22:50.10,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Why must you let one moment of anger...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.10,0:22:56.27,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,...ruin your precious health worth ten-thousand gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.57,0:23:32.82,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, do rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.16,0:23:35.08,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Do rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.55,0:23:49.16,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Sir Chen Zhen is Yuan Shao's envoy and shall be the guest of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.16,0:23:49.90,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.90,0:23:50.64,Default,Chen Zhen,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.21,0:23:54.70,Default,Chen Zhen,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.74,0:24:06.28,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.58,0:24:18.74,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.17,0:24:21.76,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Some of you are veteran officials,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.79,0:24:26.14,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,others of you are valiant warrior-generals\N who aided me in Jiangdong's conquest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.06,0:24:29.92,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,And there are those like Ziyi,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.92,0:24:32.72,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(304,499.2)\fade(255,0,255,0,0,2500,2800)}Tàishǐ Cí \NStyled: Zǐyì
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.60,0:24:32.92,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,brave heroes who were my former adversaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.46,0:24:37.12,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,For me, to have Jiāngdōng as part of my legacy,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.12,0:24:40.97,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,it is all for your work\N that we are where we are now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.97,0:24:43.52,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Come, let me raise a toast to you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.92,0:24:50.72,Default,All,0,0,0,,Your Lordship's recovery is a blessing for all of Jiangdong!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.97,0:24:51.67,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.46,0:24:59.14,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.90,0:25:05.36,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,We have strong soldiers and ample food, the people live in peace and prosperity.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.36,0:25:08.36,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,These developments are indeed gratifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.93,0:25:09.62,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.16,0:25:12.70,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,If we are to protect Jiangdong,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.70,0:25:14.84,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,we must have daring ambitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.84,0:25:18.24,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Those without ambition \Nwill surely be subject to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.41,0:25:21.97,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,We should join with Yuan Shao to defeat Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.94,0:25:25.45,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,That would be one of our greatest achievements.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.45,0:25:28.12,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, we must think of danger during peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.12,0:25:30.80,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,We must prepare supplies and troops soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.48,0:25:34.16,Thinking,Crowd,0,0,0,,Immortal Yu is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.83,0:25:38.33,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,By acquiring warships and storing supplies,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.33,0:25:41.12,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,we can then march north and besiege Xuchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.98,0:25:48.48,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Why are you looking outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.91,0:25:52.65,Default,General,0,0,0,,Down there, Immortal Yu is passing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.65,0:25:54.28,Default,General,0,0,0,,We wish to pay our respects.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.14,0:26:13.17,Default,All,0,0,0,,Sire?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.70,0:26:50.34,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,That sorcerer again!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.34,0:26:51.64,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Bring him here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.76,0:26:53.96,Default,General,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.96,0:26:55.92,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,His witchcraft manipulates people!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.92,0:26:56.24,Default,General,0,0,0,,Sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.24,0:26:58.64,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Even you soldiers are bewitched!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.64,0:27:01.70,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,At this rate, who do I have left to follow my conquests?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.80,0:27:02.70,Default,All,0,0,0,,Sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.35,0:27:06.54,Default,Huang Gai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.99,0:27:10.86,Default,Huang Gai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}This man is named Yu Ji.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.86,0:27:13.12,Default,Huang Gai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Everywhere he goes, he offers healing water.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.12,0:27:15.85,Default,Huang Gai,0,0,0,,{\bord8}He has never failed to cure patients and treat illnesses!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.85,0:27:17.48,Default,Huang Gai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}They regard him as an Immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.48,0:27:20.52,Default,Huang Gai,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My lord, you must not take him lightly!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.82,0:27:21.28,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Scram!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.97,0:27:25.07,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Get that foul heretic and slice his head off now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.07,0:27:27.60,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Anyone against this will be executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.03,0:27:30.30,Default,General,0,0,0,,Sire, you can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.05,0:27:40.75,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.32,0:27:42.23,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.82,0:27:45.78,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Master Yu has never done anything illegal!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.78,0:27:47.89,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Sire, you should not kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.89,0:27:51.10,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Foul witches must be killed like swine!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.10,0:27:53.72,Default,Chen Zhen,0,0,0,,Sir, don't you see how the people revere Yu Ji?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.40,0:27:51.99,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.72,0:27:55.66,Default,Chen Zhen,0,0,0,,Being angry at him is inadvisable!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.60,0:27:59.77,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,You are all scholars, men of reason, \Nwhy be unreasonable now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.77,0:28:03.28,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,I must vanquish this evil at all costs, for the good of men!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.81,0:28:07.16,Default,Zhou Tai,0,0,0,,General, spare him, we all plead for his life!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.11,0:28:11.92,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,You all join Yu Ji in defying me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.88,0:28:54.19,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,You dare mislead people with your witchcraft?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.00,0:28:59.64,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(990.4,497.6)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4330,4700)}Yú Jí
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.16,0:28:59.25,Default,Yu Ji,0,0,0,,I only speak on behalf of Heaven to save people.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.25,0:29:01.43,Default,Yu Ji,0,0,0,,I would never take anything from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.43,0:29:03.88,Default,Yu Ji,0,0,0,,How could I be misleading the people?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.88,0:29:08.40,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,If you take nothing, then where did you get your clothes? What do you eat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.96,0:29:12.14,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,A lying crook!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.57,0:29:16.20,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,To let you go now is to risk tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.52,0:29:17.78,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,Son, cease this!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.23,0:29:30.92,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,Son, you know killing Immortals without reason bears ill!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.94,0:29:39.34,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,As your son, I would never doubt you, mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.34,0:29:41.68,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,However, you should know my feelings too!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.41,0:29:45.30,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,My cause is not done. The empire is still in turmoil.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.71,0:29:50.78,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,This sorcerer brings disaster, lulling the officials and generals into subservience.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.78,0:29:53.36,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,The people and soldiers bend their knees in fear to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.62,0:29:58.76,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,If this continues, how can I ever realize \Nmy father's great enterprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.73,0:30:02.43,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,How could I not know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.89,0:30:07.53,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,Yet because you disrespected \Nthe deities did you invoke calamity.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.17,0:30:09.38,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,I-...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.08,0:30:12.55,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,I fear for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.28,0:30:20.28,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,The assassins at the mountain were Xu Gong's retainers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.28,0:30:22.22,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,It was my carelessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.22,0:30:25.40,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,But how could you be so confused, \Nbringing trouble to your own son!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.40,0:30:26.28,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.26,0:30:32.40,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,My son...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.49,0:30:38.20,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,Your late father was short-tempered and rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.20,0:30:43.44,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,He did not heed others, \Nand died in those mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.74,0:30:48.20,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,Now at this very same impasse, how can you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.76,0:31:42.12,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,If you are an "Immortal," why are you kneeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.00,0:31:49.00,Thinking,Crowd,0,0,0,,Immortal Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.82,0:31:54.23,Thinking,Crowd,0,0,0,,Immortal Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.23,0:32:03.30,Thinking,Crowd,0,0,0,,Immortal Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.02,0:32:11.18,Thinking,Crowd,0,0,0,,Immortal Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.84,0:32:17.67,Thinking,Crowd,0,0,0,,Immortal Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.70,0:32:21.63,Thinking,Crowd,0,0,0,,Immortal Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.61,0:33:07.68,Default,Elder Qiao,0,0,0,,How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.93,0:33:13.31,Default,Elder Qiao,0,0,0,,Why aren't you speaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.90,0:33:17.66,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.82,0:33:23.03,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,You must inform the Madam Dowager and Lady Qiao.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.39,0:33:29.00,Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,I am but a petty officer, it is not my place to speak on such matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.27,0:33:31.36,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.81,0:33:35.14,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,I am the acting leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.82,0:33:38.30,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,You can tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.22,0:33:45.10,Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,I wouldn't dare lie,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.10,0:33:48.21,Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,but our lord... he is dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.69,0:33:58.06,Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,The poison in his body has not healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.06,0:34:01.40,Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,Due to his outburst, it has spread throughout his body,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.40,0:34:03.14,Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,ravaging his heart and lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.14,0:34:05.38,Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,It is too late to heal him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.40,0:34:10.14,Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,This lowly servant has been well treated by his lordship...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.14,0:34:14.62,Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,... and I failed to save him...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.10,0:34:35.49,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.91,0:34:44.07,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,I cannot survive this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.00,0:34:53.26,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Please summon my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.06,0:34:58.27,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Zhongmou...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.21,0:35:24.41,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Zhongmou...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.68,0:35:27.08,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(980.8,425.6)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1960,2400)}Sūn Quán\NStyled: Zhòngmóu
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.92,0:35:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The realm is in chaos. But with men of Wúyuè,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.92,0:35:49.62,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Wúyuè is one of the historical names of the Jiāngnán/Jiāngdōng region
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.74,0:35:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}and the strength of Three Rivers, you will have a future.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.92,0:36:02.08,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Zibu.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.28,0:36:02.82,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.99,0:36:08.53,Default,Zhang Zhao,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.47,0:36:36.76,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}In mustering the strength of Jiangdong,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.76,0:36:40.00,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}in seizing victory between two contesting legions,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.81,0:36:44.52,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}and in contending for the world, you, my brother, cannot compare to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.58,0:36:52.32,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yet in recognizing talent, \Nin uniting all to defend Jiāngdōng,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.66,0:36:55.64,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I cannot compare to you, my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.64,0:36:59.43,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Brother, please keep in mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.23,0:37:03.99,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12}the hardship father and I went through to achieve this enterprise...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.61,0:37:07.96,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Do your utmost to keep it strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.59,0:37:13.30,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,You-!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.16,0:37:19.40,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Now is not the time to cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.87,0:37:25.80,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,You must stand up to uphold our family's legacy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.07,0:37:28.72,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.09,0:37:36.79,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.80,0:38:16.00,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Mother, I am at the end of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.74,0:38:19.67,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I can no longer serve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.66,0:38:25.67,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Now I shall entrust my seal to my younger brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.34,0:38:29.84,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Please train him day and night, mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.38,0:38:35.58,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My father and I will fade into the past...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.58,0:38:38.07,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}He must not be impetuous like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.11,0:38:45.34,Default,Lady Wu,0,0,0,,Your brother is still young, \Nhe cannot handle state matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.48,0:38:48.50,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.53,0:39:02.34,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}In matters internal, consult Zhang Zhao,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.80,0:39:10.41,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}In matters external, consult Zhou Yu.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.77,0:39:17.25,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Pity Zhōu Yú isn't here himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.25,0:39:19.98,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I cannot tell him face-to-face!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.82,0:39:47.25,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12}We have spent many years together, sharing joy and sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.40,0:39:52.24,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Take care of mother after I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.28,0:39:57.08,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Tell Xiaoqiao to inform Zhou the Youth,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.82,0:40:02.64,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}have him aid my brother as he aided me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.02,0:40:06.64,Default,Sun Ce,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Please do not betray me and the love we share!

